WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,910
Suicide snake, be careful

2
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:04,550
The Divine Word Technique of Brother Shenzi

3
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,990
Don’t worry, you’ve reached the realm of spiritual connection.

4
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:09,150
When have I ever lost a fight in front of you?

5
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:10,950
Ask Dawang to call him.

6
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:12,990
Do you believe that the Son of God died violently on the spot?

7
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:21,240
What's the point of fighting? I don't believe it. Three bets cost ten yuan. Did Miao Di Chen Haoyu tell you?

8
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:28,280
I kept that secret from him and gave me two seals of death.

9
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:38,230
God's body

10
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:42,940
God is merciful

11
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:44,860
Wait, put down your bare sword

12
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,820
Be baptized by the gods

13
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:47,980
I dare not peek at my classmates taking a shower

14
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:48,900
I have realized the light of God
